{"neofx":2,"id":"wave","name":"Wave","category":"Distort","params":[{"id":"strength","name":"Strength","min":0,"max":60,"default":20},{"id":"speed","name":"Speed","min":0,"max":10,"default":3}],"shader":"vec4 effect(vec2 uv) { vec2 q = uv; q.x += sin(uv.y * resolution.y / 40.0 + time * speed) * strength / resolution.x; return texture2D(image, q); }"}
